{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_01C5REHnGYCzFbqAhAJaRY9t","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01QKpymd5z8t5dXRDuMr8Le7","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/src/shared/view.ts","old_string":"// ── pull / status shapes (the product crossing to the harness) ────\nexport interface ViewMessage {","new_string":"// ── pull / status shapes (the product crossing to the harness) ────\n//\n// The pull's array shape (Story 1, load-bearing for Stories 2–5): band\n// messages first — one `user` message per non-empty band, gradient order\n// brief → detailed → smooth, marker header + snapshot bytes verbatim — then\n// the tail in record order. Tail messages render by the message-kind mapping\n// table (tech design §Tail message rendering), the contract every later\n// story renders into:\n//\n//   | Message kind                       | Role      | Content shape |\n//   |------------------------------------|-----------|---------------|\n//   | user_prompt                        | user      | text verbatim |\n//   | assistant_text                     | assistant | text verbatim |\n//   | assistant_thinking                 | assistant | fenced: `[thinking]\\n<text>\\n[/thinking]` — included (the tail is full fidelity) |\n//   | tool_call                          | assistant | `[tool call · <name>] <compact args>` — deterministic arg rendering, abbreviation rule for oversized args |\n//   | tool_result (ahead of boundary)    | user      | `[tool result · <name>]\\n<full content>` |\n//   | tool_result (at-or-behind boundary)| user      | `[tool result · <name> · abridged]\\n<summary or deterministic truncation>` (short-form ladder) |\n//   | runtime_note                       | user      | `[runtime note] <text>` |\nexport interface ViewMessage {"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1029,"cache_read_input_tokens":160083,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1029},"output_tokens":52,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"28aec8fc-3297-4f03-8488-65ebfbadd697","uuid":"c377b5a7-2627-45fb-b681-3400f49fbfde","request_id":"req_011CbwfEoCquj1iqmd2rj2zo"}
